{"repositoryId":1402668272,"availability":"available","full":"malikrajat/deepwork-site","name":"deepwork-site","description":"DeepWork is a free focus timer, task list, day planner and habit tracker in one window — and it keeps every byte on your own machine. Run a session, plan the day in focus blocks, and watch the week actually add up. No account. No cloud. No subscription.  Open the web app","category":"Productivity","language":"HTML","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-03T04:44:18Z","updated":"2026-10-11T02:39:12Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://deepwork-pomodoro.netlify.app/","topics":["web","web-application","web-development","webapp","website"],"demo":"https://deepwork-pomodoro.netlify.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T22:17:58.008Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T22:17:58.008Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T22:17:58.008Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-15T19:33:16.627Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-19T22:17:58.008Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["The product site for DeepWork, a free focus timer, task manager and habit tracker that keeps its data on your own machine.","This repository contains the website only. The application lives at malikrajat/deepwork, and nothing here modifies it: this project reads that repository, screenshots it and describes it.","The app is genuinely good and almost nobody knows about it. The site has one job: take someone who has never heard of DeepWork — or of the Pomodoro Technique — and get them to the point where they understand what it does, believe it, and install it."],"features":["Say the true, smaller thing. The app has no AI and no cloud, and the site says exactly that.","The product is the artwork. Every image is a screenshot of the real application, captured","Be readable by machines as well as people. Googlebot runs JavaScript; most AI crawlers do"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/malikrajat/deepwork-site/blob/main